WEBVTT

1
00:00:04,880 --> 00:00:07,560
It's the same as inviting us to stay, but now

2
00:00:07,560 --> 00:00:09,120
Showing extreme danger

3
00:00:09,120 --> 00:00:10,040
It’s Shao Ling

4
00:00:10,040 --> 00:00:11,160
I've thought it through

5
00:00:11,160 --> 00:00:13,200
I think our base is the best

6
00:00:13,200 --> 00:00:15,240
I just wanted to join our base this time

7
00:00:16,160 --> 00:00:17,360
I remember I said

8
00:00:17,360 --> 00:00:20,030
We can ensure that you leave safely at that time

9
00:00:20,030 --> 00:00:21,550
But I don't guarantee

10
00:00:21,550 --> 00:00:30,280
You can still enter safely

11
00:00:30,280 --> 00:00:32,810
Original fresh golden river

12
00:00:32,810 --> 00:00:34,410
So delicious

13
00:00:34,410 --> 00:00:41,760
I'm back

14
00:00:41,760 --> 00:00:44,680
I was so scared just now

15
00:00:44,680 --> 00:00:46,080
When he was hugging me

16
00:00:46,080 --> 00:00:47,960
I even want to die with him

17
00:00:47,960 --> 00:00:49,330
But I can't do it either
